T* (Flask-based web application developed by Soumyadip Porel for final-year BCA project requirements. The system) Tj
T* (predicts customer churn probability and classifies account holders into four distinct risk levels \(Low, Medium, High,) Tj
T* (Very High\) to empower retail banking retention.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Key Model Performance Indicators:) Tj
T* (• Final Model: HistGradientBoostingClassifier) Tj
